text.en:
The following sitios in the Municipality of Dumingag, Province of Zamboanga del Sur, are converted into barrios of said municipality, to wit:
Sitio Bag-ong Basak to Barrio Bag-ong Basak;
Sitio Bag-ong Princesa to Barrio Bag-ong Princesa;
Sitio Bag-ong Valencia to Barrio Bag-ong Valencia;
